Bug 1775061 - Show the response options in the series attendance submenus again. r=mkmelin

Opening the context menu on a non-recurring event hid the send and don't-send items of the series submenus, and nothing showed them again, so they stayed empty for every later occurrence.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331213


